        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 26 at 1:29PM EDT until September 27 at 12:00PM EDT by NWS Mount Holly NJ</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 20 to 30 kt with gusts up to 45 kt and very
rough waters.

* WHERE...Delaware Bay waters north of East Point NJ to
Slaughter Beach DE.

* WHEN...Until noon EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds will cause hazardous seas which could
capsize or damage vessels and reduce visibility.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners should alter plans to avoid these hazardous conditions.
Remain in port, seek safe harbor, alter course, and/or secure the
vessel for hazardous conditions.</instruction>
